<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Feb 13 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Feb 13 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $990.2 million in the week to February 13 from $1.003 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     57.84		70.62</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     28.60		47.84</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  932.40	     933.27</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    232.43	     224.36</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	729.56	     726.90</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    260.68	     277.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
